abstract: >-
  Educational C++ repository of college Data Structures and Algorithms (DSA)
  laboratory programs: linked lists, stacks, queues, binary search trees,
  sorting algorithms, hash tables, graph BFS, templates, and OOP examples.
  Structured with topic-named folders for students, search engines, and LLMs.
